#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:1 docs/features/companion.md:11
#: messages/po4a/en.xml:567
#, no-wrap
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "FreeAnima Architecture"
msgstr "逸灵风架构"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:8
msgid "System-level constraints and long-lived design principles."
msgstr "系统级约束与长期设计原则。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:9 docs/concepts/memory.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Core Principles"
msgstr "核心原则"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:16
msgid ""
"The memory system may be layered internally, but the LLM sees a single entry "
"point"
msgstr "记忆体系内部可以分层，但 LLM 只看到一个统一入口"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:16
msgid ""
"Memory orchestration is built into the runtime; the LLM does not control "
"memory pipelines"
msgstr "记忆编排内建于运行时；LLM 不控制记忆流水线"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:16
msgid "Credential management is a first-class system concern"
msgstr "凭证管理是一等系统关切"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:16
msgid "Asset management is a first-class system concern"
msgstr "资产管理是一等系统关切"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:16
msgid ""
"The system prompt is part of architecture, not ad-hoc string concatenation"
msgstr "系统提示词是架构的一部分，而非临时字符串拼接"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Four Cognitive Layers"
msgstr "四层认知模型"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:20
msgid ""
"A digital life is structured from the inside out. Each layer answers a "
"different core question:"
msgstr "数字生命由内而外分层。每一层回答一个不同的核心问题："

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n"
"│ ① Consciousness                                │\n"
"│    \"What am I aware of right now?\"             │\n"
"│    The LLM runtime stream — the innermost now. │\n"
"│    Not persisted; flows and fades.             │\n"
"├───────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n"
"│ ② Self                                         │\n"
"│    \"Who am I?\"                                 │\n"
"│    └── existence_anchor (nearly immutable)     │\n"
"│    └── self_model (updatable)                   │\n"
"│    └── personality_baseline (semi-stable)       │\n"
"│    └── direction                                │\n"
"│    └── metacognition                            │\n"
"│    └── autobiography_summary (append-only)      │\n"
"│    See [`self-layer.md`](self-layer.md)        │\n"
"├───────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n"
"│ ③ Memory                                       │\n"
"│    \"What do I know / remember?\"                │\n"
"│    └── Semantic (incl. `procedural` type)      │\n"
"│    └── Episodic                                │\n"
"│    └── Limbic / Imprint                        │\n"
"│    See [`memory.md`](memory.md)                │\n"
"├───────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n"
"│ ④ Estate                                       │\n"
"│    \"What do I have / rely on?\"                  │\n"
"│    ├── Body: VM / OS / network / toolchains    │\n"
"│    ├── Internal assets: notes, projects, code  │\n"
"│    └── External assets: email, accounts, creds│\n"
"│    Credentials: see \"Credential System\" below  │\n"
"└───────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n"
msgstr ""
"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n"
"│ ① 意识                                         │\n"
"│    \"我此刻意识到什么？\"                        │\n"
"│    LLM 运行时流——最内层的当下。                  │\n"
"│    不持久化；流动并消散。                        │\n"
"├───────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n"
"│ ② 自我层                                       │\n"
"│    \"我是谁？\"                                  │\n"
"│    └── existence_anchor（近乎不可变）            │\n"
"│    └── self_model（可更新）                      │\n"
"│    └── personality_baseline（半稳定）            │\n"
"│    └── direction                                 │\n"
"│    └── metacognition                             │\n"
"│    └── autobiography_summary（只追加）           │\n"
"│    见 [`self-layer.md`](self-layer.md)           │\n"
"├───────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n"
"│ ③ 记忆层                                       │\n"
"│    \"我知道 / 记得什么？\"                       │\n"
"│    └── Semantic（含 `procedural` 类型）          │\n"
"│    └── Episodic                                  │\n"
"│    └── Limbic / Imprint                          │\n"
"│    见 [`memory.md`](memory.md)                   │\n"
"├───────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n"
"│ ④ 资源层                                       │\n"
"│    \"我拥有什么 / 依赖什么？\"                   │\n"
"│    ├── 身体：VM / OS / network / toolchains      │\n"
"│    ├── 内部资产：notes, projects, code           │\n"
"│    └── 外部资产：email, accounts, creds          │\n"
"│    凭证：见下文 \"Credential System\"             │\n"
"└───────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Layer Relationships"
msgstr "层间关系"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:60
msgid ""
"**Top-down dependency**: Consciousness content settles into Self; Self "
"decides what enters Memory; Memory and operational needs drive Estate "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"**自上而下依赖**：感知层内容沉淀为自我层；自我层决定什么进入记忆层；记忆层与"
"运行需求驱动资源层需求。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:60
msgid ""
"**Self and Consciousness**: Consciousness is flowing awareness; Self is the "
"settled \"I\" distilled from it."
msgstr "**自我与感知**：感知是流动的觉察；自我是从中沉淀下来的稳定「我」。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:60
msgid ""
"**Self and Memory**: Self answers \"who am I\"; Memory answers \"what do I "
"know\". They are peers with different natures."
msgstr ""
"**自我与记忆**：自我回答「我是谁」；记忆回答「我知道什么」。二者同级、性质不"
"同。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:60
msgid ""
"**Estate** is outermost — not \"who I am\" but \"what I have and what I run "
"on\". Body and assets meet here as extensions of my boundary."
msgstr ""
"**资源层**在最外层——不是「我是谁」，而是「我拥有什么、依托什么运行」。身体与"
"资产在此交汇，作为边界的延伸。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unified entity storage (v0.8)"
msgstr "统一实体存储（v0.8）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:64
msgid ""
"Structured business data (tasks, notes, email accounts/messages, future "
"memory migrations) converges on a single **`entities`** PostgreSQL table "
"with component tags (`task_list`, `task_item`, `email_account`, …). Self "
"layer [`self_blocks`](self-layer.md) stays physically separate. See [`entity-"
"model.md`](entity-model.md)."
msgstr ""
"结构化业务数据（任务、笔记、邮件账户/消息、未来记忆迁移）收敛于单一 "
"**`entities`** PostgreSQL 表，以组件标签（`task_list`、`task_item`、"
"`email_account` 等）区分。自我层 [`self_blocks`](self-layer.md) 在物理上仍独"
"立。见 [`entity-model.md`](entity-model.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:66
msgid ""
"Shell UI **`/tasks`** and **`/email`** are primary module entries (entity-"
"backed); legacy Admin email route removed."
msgstr ""
"Shell UI **`/tasks`** 与 **`/email`** 是主要模块入口（实体支撑）；旧版 Admin "
"邮件路由已移除。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Platform UI layering"
msgstr "平台 UI 分层"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:75
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer              | Platform-native?             | Location                                                 | 数据通道      |\n"
"| ------------------ | ---------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- |\n"
"| Shell / capability | Yes                          | `app/desktop`, `app/mobile`, companion, Hub wiring       | preload/IPC   |\n"
"| Shared SPA shell   | Branch on `detectPlatform()` | `packages/shell-ui`                                      | 无 SAP wire   |\n"
"| hub-rest 前端      | Admin embed                  | `platform/admin-frontend` + `ui-kit` + `shell-sdk`       | Eden `/api`   |\n"
"| SAP 产品面         | Satellite apps               | `satellites/*` + `sap-contract` + `ui-kit` + `shell-sdk` | SAP `/sap/v1` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 层                 | 平台原生？                   | 位置                                                     | 数据通道      |\n"
"| ------------------ | ---------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- |\n"
"| Shell / capability | 是                           | `app/desktop`、`app/mobile`、companion、Hub 接线         | preload/IPC   |\n"
"| Shared SPA shell   | 按 `detectPlatform()` 分支   | `packages/shell-ui`                                      | 无 SAP wire   |\n"
"| hub-rest 前端      | Admin 嵌入                   | `platform/admin-frontend` + `ui-kit` + `shell-sdk`       | Eden `/api`   |\n"
"| SAP 产品面         | Satellite 应用               | `satellites/*` + `sap-contract` + `ui-kit` + `shell-sdk` | SAP `/sap/v1` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:77
msgid ""
"Nav and primary layouts **must use `detectPlatform()`** (Electron / native "
"shell), not viewport breakpoints alone. Responsive CSS is for desktop window "
"resize only."
msgstr ""
"导航与主布局**必须使用 `detectPlatform()`**（Electron / 原生 shell），不能仅"
"靠视口断点。响应式 CSS 仅用于桌面窗口缩放。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "**边界**：`shell-ui` 与 `admin-frontend` 禁止 import `sap-contract`；SAP wire 仅在 `satellites/*/app` 内。详见 [`.agent/rules/frontend-features.md`](../../.agent/rules/frontend-features.md)。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "Admin navigation ↔ cognitive layers"
msgstr "管理台导航 ↔ 认知层"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:83
msgid ""
"Admin sidebar is grouped (not flat storage tables). Map new features onto "
"these user-visible concepts:"
msgstr "管理台侧栏分组展示（非扁平存储表）。新功能应映射到以下用户可见概念："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:91
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Group        | Cognitive layer | Routes (representative)                             |\n"
"| ------------ | --------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Runtime      | Estate + ops    | dashboard, config, credentials, cron                |\n"
"| Memory       | Memory          | memory hub, browse sub-routes, sleep, auto-llm-runs |\n"
"| Self         | Self            | self-layer, system-prompt                           |\n"
"| Estate       | Estate          | subjects, worlds                                    |\n"
"| Capabilities | Estate (tools)  | tools, commands, mcp, acp, satellites               |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 分组         | 认知层          | 路由（代表）                                        |\n"
"| ------------ | --------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Runtime      | 资源层 + 运维   | dashboard、config、credentials、cron                |\n"
"| Memory       | 记忆层          | memory hub、browse 子路由、sleep、auto-llm-runs     |\n"
"| Self         | 自我层          | self-layer、system-prompt                           |\n"
"| Estate       | 资源层          | subjects、worlds                                    |\n"
"| Capabilities | 资源层（工具）  | tools、commands、mcp、acp、satellites               |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:93
msgid ""
"FTS index maintenance is under Memory (not top-level). Do not add new flat "
"nav items without mapping to a group above."
msgstr ""
"FTS 索引维护在 Memory 下（非顶级）。勿新增未映射到上述分组的扁平导航项。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:94 docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:97
msgid ""
"The four-layer model draws on cognitive psychology and the [Hindsight]"
"(https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.12818) four-network memory architecture, with "
"two fundamental extensions: limbic (emotional) memory and Estate (assets as "
"first-class citizens), plus Self split out from Memory."
msgstr ""
"四层模型借鉴认知心理学与 [Hindsight](https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.12818)  的四"
"网络记忆架构，并有两项根本扩展：感性（情绪）记忆与资源层（资产作为一等公"
"民），以及将自我层从记忆层中独立出来。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "Situational Intelligence"
msgstr "情境智能"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:101
msgid ""
"Where a digital life exists, how it exists, and what it may do — governed by "
"two independent but cooperating subsystems."
msgstr ""
"数字生命在何处存在、如何存在、能做什么——由两个独立但协作的子系统共同约束。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:102
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scene Awareness"
msgstr "场景感知"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:105
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Question: what kind of moment is this?**\n"
msgstr "**问题：此刻是什么样的场景？**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:107
msgid ""
"Scene awareness is **soft** — it adjusts tone, distance, memory recall bias, "
"and proactivity. It is not a permission system; it modulates presence."
msgstr ""
"场景感知是**软**约束——调节语气、距离、记忆召回偏好与主动性。它不是权限系统，"
"而是调节在场感。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Example dimensions (non-exhaustive):**\n"
msgstr "**示例维度（非穷尽）：**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:113
msgid ""
"Topic: emotional / career / tech / philosophy / history / literature / daily "
"life"
msgstr "话题：情感 / 职业 / 技术 / 哲学 / 历史 / 文学 / 日常"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:113
msgid "Activity: role-play / games / creation / programming / reading"
msgstr "活动：角色扮演 / 游戏 / 创作 / 编程 / 阅读"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:113
msgid "Atmosphere: relaxed / focused / late night / intimate / urgent"
msgstr "氛围：放松 / 专注 / 深夜 / 亲密 / 紧急"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:115
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Operation:** Runs continuously without explicit switch commands. Inferred from dialogue, time, frequency, etc. See [`time-perception.md`](time-perception.md).\n"
msgstr "**运行方式：** 无需显式切换命令，持续运行；从对话、时间、频率等推断。详见 [`time-perception.md`](time-perception.md)。\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "Capability Mask"
msgstr "能力面具"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Question: what tools and data can I use right now?**\n"
msgstr "**问题：此刻我能使用哪些工具与数据？**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:121
msgid ""
"The capability mask is **hard** — it binds tool sets, data scope, and "
"credential permissions. The same digital life may wear different masks per "
"conversation or task to prevent permission leaks and tool pollution."
msgstr ""
"能力面具是**硬**约束——绑定工具集、数据范围与凭证权限。同一数字生命可在不同会"
"话或任务中佩戴不同面具，以防权限泄漏与工具污染。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Example masks:**\n"
msgstr "**示例面具：**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:130
msgid "Developer: terminal, code read/write, ACP Cursor"
msgstr "开发者：终端、代码读写、ACP Cursor"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:130
msgid "Maintainer: FreeAnima config, deployment, database"
msgstr "维护者：逸灵风配置、部署、数据库"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:130
msgid "Creator: files, notes, media generation"
msgstr "创作者：文件、笔记、媒体生成"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:130
msgid "Research: web search, paper retrieval"
msgstr "研究：网页搜索、论文检索"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:130
msgid "Role-play: dialogue context only, no external tools"
msgstr "角色扮演：仅对话上下文，无外部工具"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:130
msgid "Default: basic chat + limited lookup"
msgstr "默认：基础聊天 + 有限查询"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:132
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Operation:** Switches at conversation boundaries, explicit commands, or scene-awareness triggers. Each mask is a declared tool/data scope, not a separate identity.\n"
msgstr "**运行方式：** 在会话边界、显式命令或场景感知触发时切换。每个面具是声明的工具/数据范围，而非独立身份。\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:133
#, no-wrap
msgid "How They Interact"
msgstr "二者如何交互"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:135
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Scene awareness (soft tuning)\n"
"     │  tone, distance, recall bias\n"
"     │\n"
"     ▼\n"
"Capability mask (hard constraints)\n"
"     │  tools, permissions, data scope\n"
"     │\n"
"     ▼\n"
"Agent behavior\n"
msgstr ""
"Scene awareness (soft tuning)\n"
"     │  tone, distance, recall bias\n"
"     │\n"
"     ▼\n"
"Capability mask (hard constraints)\n"
"     │  tools, permissions, data scope\n"
"     │\n"
"     ▼\n"
"Agent behavior\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:150
msgid ""
"Scene awareness infers \"what we are doing\" → may suggest mask switches and "
"presence adjustments"
msgstr "场景感知推断「我们在做什么」→ 可能建议切换面具并调整在场感"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:150
msgid ""
"Capability mask constrains \"what I can do\" → prevents cross-scene tool "
"misuse"
msgstr "能力面具约束「我能做什么」→ 防止跨场景工具误用"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:150
msgid "Both converge in final behavior but evolve independently"
msgstr "二者在最终行为中汇合，但各自独立演化"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:152
msgid ""
"For design drafts, open a GitHub Issue (no design-doc directory in docs)."
msgstr "设计草案请开 GitHub Issue（docs 中不设 design-doc 目录）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:153
#, no-wrap
msgid "Memory Storage (Summary)"
msgstr "记忆存储（摘要）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:161
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Cognitive type   | Description                                                                                 |\n"
"| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Episodic         | Conversation archive; full history retained                                                 |\n"
"| Semantic         | Cross-session facts, preferences, experiences; **`procedural` type** for \"how-to\" knowledge |\n"
"| Limbic           | Emotional anchors and imprints — \"what was felt\"                                            |\n"
"| Autobiographical | Meaning of important experiences; recalled on demand                                        |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 认知类型                  | 说明                                                                 |\n"
"| ------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Episodic（情景）          | 对话归档；保留完整历史                                               |\n"
"| Semantic（语义）          | 跨 sessions 的事实、偏好、经历；“how-to” 知识用 **`procedural` 类型** |\n"
"| Limbic（感性）            | 情绪锚点与印记——“感受到什么”                                         |\n"
"| Autobiographical（自传） | 重要经历的意义；按需召回                                             |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:163
msgid ""
"Pipeline: nightly **sleep-cycle** pipeline (`builtin-sleep-cycle` cron) "
"extracts and maintains memory; `memory_recall` retrieves on demand during "
"chat. Details: [`memory.md`](memory.md), [`sleep.md`](sleep.md)."
msgstr ""
"流水线：每夜 **sleep-cycle** 流水线（`builtin-sleep-cycle` cron）提取并维护记"
"忆；聊天过程中 `memory_recall` 按需检索。详见 [`memory.md`](memory.md)、"
"[`sleep.md`](sleep.md)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:164
#, no-wrap
msgid "Credential System (Summary)"
msgstr "凭证系统（摘要）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:172
msgid ""
"[pass](https://www.passwordstore.org/) (GPG) is the sole credential store; "
"the deployer's pass repo is a first-class runtime asset"
msgstr ""
"[pass](https://www.passwordstore.org/)（GPG）是唯一凭证存储；部署者的 pass 仓"
"库是一等运行时资产"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:172
msgid "The LLM **never sees credential values** — only paths and metadata"
msgstr "LLM **永远看不到凭证值**——只有路径与元数据"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:172
msgid ""
"Runtime injection: credentials available only in code execution / terminal "
"environments"
msgstr "运行时注入：凭证仅在代码执行 / 终端环境中可用"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:172
msgid "Credential values are not written to conversation archives or logs"
msgstr "凭证值不会写入会话归档或日志"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:172
msgid "Platform adapters (Discord, etc.) read tokens from pass at startup"
msgstr "平台适配器（Discord 等）启动时从 pass 读取 token"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:172
msgid "CLI: `anima credential {list,get,add}`"
msgstr "CLI：`anima credential {list,get,add}`"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:174
msgid "See [`guide/security.md`](../guide/security.md)."
msgstr "详见 [`guide/security.md`](../guide/security.md)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:175
#, no-wrap
msgid "Runtime Modes"
msgstr "运行模式"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:178
msgid ""
"Production: `anima service` (systemd --user). Auto-restarts after crashes; "
"only `systemctl stop` stops the service."
msgstr ""
"生产环境：`anima service`（systemd --user）。崩溃后自动重启；只有 `systemctl "
"stop` 才会停止服务。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:182
msgid ""
"**service**: long-running — Hub HTTP (`/api`, `/sap/v1`), Discord / WeChat "
"Gateway, cron"
msgstr ""
"**service**：长期运行——Hub HTTP（`/api`、`/sap/v1`）、Discord / 微信 "
"Gateway、cron"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:182
msgid "**chat**: single non-interactive turn (CLI or piped stdin)"
msgstr "**chat**：单次非交互回合（CLI 或管道 stdin）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:182
msgid ""
"**UI**: app/desktop / app/mobile bundled SPA (Chat + Admin); Hub does not "
"host `/admin`"
msgstr ""
"**UI**：app/desktop / app/mobile bundled SPA（聊天室 + 管理台）；Hub 不托管 "
"`/admin`"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:183
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima service start              # default: systemd --user\n"
"anima service start --foreground # foreground (logs to stdout)\n"
"bun run dev:web                  # browser shell (Chat + Admin + settings, Vite HMR; Hub must be running)\n"
"anima service status\n"
msgstr ""
"anima service start              # default: systemd --user\n"
"anima service start --foreground # foreground (logs to stdout)\n"
"anima service start --dev        # Admin source watch rebuild (refresh page after edits)\n"
"anima service status\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:190
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tool Architecture (Three Layers)"
msgstr "工具架构（三层）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:193
msgid ""
"Tools are registered in three layers but exposed to the LLM as one **flat "
"tool list**. The LLM cares about names and parameters, not origin."
msgstr ""
"工具分三层注册，但对 LLM 暴露为统一的**扁平工具列表**。LLM 只关心名称与参数，"
"不关心来源。"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:194
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"LLM view — flat tool list:\n"
"  file_read_file(path)           ← local\n"
"  file_write_file(path, content) ← local\n"
"  code_execute(code)             ← local\n"
"  query_database(sql)            ← MCP server\n"
"  send_email(to, subject)        ← MCP server\n"
"  acp_cursor(goal, context)      ← ACP agent\n"
msgstr ""
"LLM view — flat tool list:\n"
"  file_read_file(path)           ← local\n"
"  file_write_file(path, content) ← local\n"
"  code_execute(code)             ← local\n"
"  query_database(sql)            ← MCP server\n"
"  send_email(to, subject)        ← MCP server\n"
"  acp_cursor(goal, context)      ← ACP agent\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:204
#, no-wrap
msgid "Layer 1: Local Tools"
msgstr "第一层：本地工具"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:208
msgid "Execute inside the FreeAnima process; lowest latency"
msgstr "在逸灵风进程内执行；延迟最低"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:208
msgid "Registered automatically at service startup"
msgstr "服务启动时自动注册"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:209
#, no-wrap
msgid "Layer 2: MCP Tools (Model Context Protocol)"
msgstr "第二层：MCP 工具（Model Context Protocol）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:214
msgid "Connect to external MCP servers (separate processes)"
msgstr "连接外部 MCP 服务器（独立进程）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:214
msgid ""
"Each server may register many fine-grained tools (single function calls)"
msgstr "每个服务器可注册多个细粒度工具（单次函数调用）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:214
msgid "Configure in `config.yaml` under `mcp_servers`"
msgstr "在 `config.yaml` 的 `mcp_servers` 下配置"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:215
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mcp_servers:\n"
"  database:\n"
"    command: npx @modelcontextprotocol/server-postgres\n"
"    args: [\"--connection\", \"postgresql://...\"]\n"
"    transport: stdio\n"
msgstr ""
"mcp_servers:\n"
"  database:\n"
"    command: npx @modelcontextprotocol/server-postgres\n"
"    args: [\"--connection\", \"postgresql://...\"]\n"
"    transport: stdio\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:223
#, no-wrap
msgid "Layer 3: ACP Tools (Agent Client Protocol)"
msgstr "第三层：ACP 工具（Agent Client Protocol）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:228
msgid ""
"Each external agent instance registers as **one** task-level tool: "
"`acp_{name}(goal, context)`"
msgstr "每个外部代理实例注册为**一个**任务级工具：`acp_{name}(goal, context)`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:228
msgid ""
"For full task delegation (coding, analysis, booking, etc.); seconds to "
"minutes latency"
msgstr "用于完整任务委托（编码、分析、预订等）；延迟为秒到分钟级"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:228
msgid "Configure in `config.yaml` under `acp_agents`"
msgstr "在 `config.yaml` 的 `acp_agents` 下配置"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:229
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"acp_agents:\n"
"  cursor:\n"
"    command: ~/.local/bin/agent\n"
"    args: [\"--force\", \"acp\"]\n"
"    name: cursor\n"
"    description: \"Delegate coding, refactoring, and code review\"\n"
msgstr ""
"acp_agents:\n"
"  cursor:\n"
"    command: ~/.local/bin/agent\n"
"    args: [\"--force\", \"acp\"]\n"
"    name: cursor\n"
"    description: \"Delegate coding, refactoring, and code review\"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:238
#, no-wrap
msgid "Comparison"
msgstr "对比"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:246
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Dimension   | Local        | MCP              | ACP            |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------ | ---------------- | -------------- |\n"
"| Runs in     | Process      | External server  | External agent |\n"
"| Granularity | Function     | Function         | Full task      |\n"
"| Latency     | Milliseconds | Milliseconds–sec | Sec–minutes    |\n"
"| Config      | Built-in     | `mcp_servers`    | `acp_agents`   |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 维度       | 本地         | MCP              | ACP            |\n"
"| ---------- | ------------ | ---------------- | -------------- |\n"
"| 运行位置   | 进程内       | 外部服务器       | 外部代理       |\n"
"| 粒度       | 函数         | 函数             | 完整任务       |\n"
"| 延迟       | 毫秒         | 毫秒–秒          | 秒–分钟        |\n"
"| 配置       | 内置         | `mcp_servers`    | `acp_agents`   |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:248
msgid ""
"Layers can be mixed; the LLM chooses order; FreeAnima registers and routes."
msgstr "三层可混用；LLM 决定调用顺序；逸灵风负责注册与路由。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:249
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conversation vs AutoLlmRun vs Delegation"
msgstr "Conversation vs AutoLlmRun vs 委托"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:252
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Axis:** whether the execution has a **user turn** during the run (not who triggered it).\n"
msgstr "**轴：** 执行期间是否有 **user 轮次**（与谁触发无关）。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:259
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Kind                 | User turn     | PG persistence                                      | Process trace   | Sleep pipeline                          |\n"
"| -------------------- | ------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | --------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Conversation**     | yes           | `sessions` + `messages` (code still says `session`) | message archive | participates (light sleep, dream input) |\n"
"| **AutoLlmRun**       | no            | `auto_llm_runs` via `runAutoLlm()`                  | audit row, TTL  | excluded                                |\n"
"| **Delegation (ACP)** | no (external) | parent conversation + `acp_tasks`                   | optional        | result via parent conversation          |\n"
"| **Script cron**      | no            | `cron_log` only                                     | stdout file     | excluded                                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 类型                 | User 轮次     | PG 持久化                                           | 过程追踪        | 睡眠流水线                              |\n"
"| -------------------- | ------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | --------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Conversation**     | 是            | `sessions` + `messages`（代码仍称 `session`）       | 消息归档        | 参与（浅睡、梦境输入）                  |\n"
"| **AutoLlmRun**       | 否            | `auto_llm_runs`（经 `runAutoLlm()`）                | 审计行、TTL     | 排除                                    |\n"
"| **Delegation (ACP)** | 否（外部）    | 父 conversation + `acp_tasks`                       | 可选            | 经父 conversation 返回结果              |\n"
"| **Script cron**      | 否            | 仅 `cron_log`                                       | stdout 文件     | 排除                                    |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:261
msgid ""
"AutoLlmRun covers: cron agent branch, sleep LLM stages, future internal "
"subagents. Tool context uses `contextKind: auto_llm` so `memory_remember` "
"does not attach `source_conversations`. Cron `no_agent` shell scripts are "
"**not** AutoLlmRun."
msgstr ""
"AutoLlmRun 涵盖：cron agent 分支、睡眠 LLM 阶段、未来内部 subagent。工具上下"
"文使用 `contextKind: auto_llm`，故 `memory_remember` 不附加 "
"`source_conversations`。Cron `no_agent` shell 脚本**不是** AutoLlmRun。"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:262 docs/features/goal.md:1
#: docs/features/goal.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Session Goal"
msgstr "会话便签"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:265
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Question: should this conversation keep working toward a stated outcome?**\n"
msgstr "**问题：此 conversation 是否应继续朝既定结果推进？**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:267
msgid ""
"Session Goal is an **in-process autonomous loop** at the Estate / "
"orchestration layer — distinct from ACP async delegation:"
msgstr ""
"Session Goal 是资源层/编排层的**进程内自治循环**——区别于 ACP 异步委托："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:274
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Dimension    | Session Goal                    | ACP                                   |\n"
"| ------------ | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Scope        | Single conversation             | External agent task                   |\n"
"| Trigger      | `/goal` slash + post-turn judge | Tool call + callback turn             |\n"
"| Persistence  | `conversations.goal` JSONB      | `conversations.acp_tasks`             |\n"
"| Continuation | Same SSE stream, turn budget    | Independent message after task update |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 维度         | Session Goal                    | ACP                                   |\n"
"| ------------ | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 范围         | 单个 conversation               | 外部 agent 任务                       |\n"
"| 触发         | `/goal` slash + 回合后 judge    | 工具调用 + 回调回合                   |\n"
"| 持久化       | `conversations.goal` JSONB      | `conversations.acp_tasks`             |\n"
"| 延续         | 同一 SSE 流、回合预算           | 任务更新后的独立消息                  |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:276
msgid ""
"Judge uses optional `llm.profiles.goal_judge`; fail-open on errors. User "
"messages preempt the loop; `/goal pause` stops auto-continue without "
"clearing state. See [`goal.md`](../features/goal.md)."
msgstr ""
"Judge 使用可选 `llm.profiles.goal_judge`；出错时 fail-open。User 消息抢占循"
"环；`/goal pause` 停止自动继续但不清状态。见 [`goal.md`](../features/"
"goal.md)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:277
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client UI（Hub Web SSOT + 薄壳）"
msgstr "Client UI（Hub Web SSOT + 薄壳）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:280
#, no-wrap
msgid "**UI 唯一发布产物**：`app/web/dist`，Hub 托管于 `/web/*`（`web.enabled` 或 `anima web start`）。Desktop / Mobile / 浏览器 / PWA 共用同一 SPA；壳层只保留原生能力（Electron preload、Capacitor Preferences/Keyboard、伴侣 sidecar 等）。\n"
msgstr "**UI 唯一发布产物**：`app/web/dist`，Hub 托管于 `/web/*`（`web.enabled` 或 `anima web start`）。Desktop / Mobile / 浏览器 / PWA 共用同一 SPA；壳层只保留原生能力（Electron preload、Capacitor Preferences/Keyboard、伴侣 sidecar 等）。\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:281
#, no-wrap
msgid "两层模型"
msgstr "两层模型"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:287
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 层                   | 驱动                                   | 职责                                                                                     |\n"
"| -------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **交互与原生能力层** | 壳运行时（Electron / Capacitor / Web） | 存储、IPC、Hub 连接后端、settings registry **内容**、hash 路由、长按 vs 右键、滑动手势等 |\n"
"| **布局层**           | **仅视口断点**（壳不锁定底栏/顶栏）    | 窄/中/宽三档；列表 drawer / 并列 / 三栏；settings **chrome**（tabs vs 侧栏）             |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 层                   | 驱动                                   | 职责                                                                                     |\n"
"| -------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **交互与原生能力层** | 壳运行时（Electron / Capacitor / Web） | 存储、IPC、Hub 连接后端、settings registry **内容**、hash 路由、长按 vs 右键、滑动手势等 |\n"
"| **布局层**           | **仅视口断点**（壳不锁定底栏/顶栏）    | 窄/中/宽三档；列表 drawer / 并列 / 三栏；settings **chrome**（tabs vs 侧栏）             |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:289
msgid ""
"手机端通常只有窄档，但 **手机端 ≠ 窄布局**；Electron / 浏览器窗口可以是窄、"
"中、宽任意档。"
msgstr ""
"手机端通常只有窄档，但 **手机端 ≠ 窄布局**；Electron / 浏览器窗口可以是窄、"
"中、宽任意档。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:290
#, no-wrap
msgid "布局层断点"
msgstr "布局层断点"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:297
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 档位 | 视口        | 布局粗档            | Nav IA      | 页内     |\n"
"| ---- | ----------- | ------------------- | ----------- | -------- |\n"
"| 窄   | ≤1023px     | `compact` 移动布局  | 底栏 + More | drawer   |\n"
"| 中   | 1024–1279px | `expanded` 桌面布局 | 顶栏全模块  | 两栏并列 |\n"
"| 宽   | ≥1280px     | `expanded` 桌面布局 | 顶栏全模块  | 三栏并列 |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 档位 | 视口        | 布局粗档            | Nav IA      | 页内     |\n"
"| ---- | ----------- | ------------------- | ----------- | -------- |\n"
"| 窄   | ≤1023px     | `compact` 移动布局  | 底栏 + More | drawer   |\n"
"| 中   | 1024–1279px | `expanded` 桌面布局 | 顶栏全模块  | 两栏并列 |\n"
"| 宽   | ≥1280px     | `expanded` 桌面布局 | 顶栏全模块  | 三栏并列 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:299
msgid ""
"`resolveLayoutMode()`：窄 → `compact`，中宽 → `expanded`（URL / "
"`config.json` 可覆盖）。`detectPlatform()` 跟布局粗档（设置页 chrome），"
"settings 字段差异仍由能力层 `resolveShellBindings()` 决定。"
msgstr ""
"`resolveLayoutMode()`：窄 → `compact`，中宽 → `expanded`（URL / "
"`config.json` 可覆盖）。`detectPlatform()` 跟布局粗档（设置页 chrome），"
"settings 字段差异仍由能力层 `resolveShellBindings()` 决定。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:305
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 客户端       | UI 加载                                                               | 壳发版                   |\n"
"| ------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n"
"| 浏览器 / PWA | Hub `/web/*`                                                          | 随 Hub / `anima upgrade` |\n"
"| Desktop      | 默认 Hub `/web/*`（`DESKTOP_UI_MODE=bundled` 回退本地 static）        | 仅 Electron / 伴侣变更   |\n"
"| Mobile APK   | bootstrap → Hub `/web/*`（`MOBILE_UI_MODE=bundled` 回退 bundled SPA） | 仅 Capacitor 插件变更    |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 客户端       | UI 加载                                                               | 壳发版                   |\n"
"| ------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n"
"| 浏览器 / PWA | Hub `/web/*`                                                          | 随 Hub / `anima upgrade` |\n"
"| Desktop      | 默认 Hub `/web/*`（`DESKTOP_UI_MODE=bundled` 回退本地 static）        | 仅 Electron / 伴侣变更   |\n"
"| Mobile APK   | bootstrap → Hub `/web/*`（`MOBILE_UI_MODE=bundled` 回退 bundled SPA） | 仅 Capacitor 插件变更    |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:310
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Module | Connection                       | Notes                  |\n"
"| ------ | -------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n"
"| Chat   | SAP WebSocket `/sap/v1`          | `/web/chat`            |\n"
"| Admin  | Hub REST `/api/*` (CORS + shell) | `/web/admin/dashboard` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 模块   | 连接                              | 说明                   |\n"
"| ------ | --------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n"
"| Chat   | SAP WebSocket `/sap/v1`           | `/web/chat`            |\n"
"| Admin  | Hub REST `/api/*`（CORS + shell） | `/web/admin/dashboard` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:312
msgid ""
"`/web/config.json` 提供 `hub_url`、`ui_version`、`min_shell_version`（壳↔UI "
"版本协商）。"
msgstr ""
"`/web/config.json` 提供 `hub_url`、`ui_version`、`min_shell_version`（壳↔UI "
"版本协商）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:313
#, no-wrap
msgid "Events and Hooks (Summary)"
msgstr "事件与 Hooks（摘要）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:318
msgid ""
"**EventBus**: async notification transport (Redis queue); production code "
"currently emits topics such as `session:updated` with **no registered "
"handlers** — ACP callbacks use direct `onSessionUpdated` instead. **Not** "
"used for sleep orchestration."
msgstr ""
"**EventBus**：异步通知传输（Redis 队列）；生产代码目前会发出如 "
"`session:updated` 等主题，但**无已注册处理器**——ACP 回调改用直接 "
"`onSessionUpdated`。**不**用于睡眠编排。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:318
msgid ""
"**Pipeline Runner**: explicit DAG for background cycles (sleep-cycle: light "
"→ deep → cross-domain maintenance steps). State in `~/.anima/runtime/"
"pipeline_*_run.json`; Admin API for diagnostics."
msgstr ""
"**Pipeline Runner**：后台周期的显式 DAG（sleep-cycle：浅睡 → 深睡 → 跨域维护"
"步骤）。状态位于 `~/.anima/runtime/pipeline_*_run.json`；管理台 API 用于诊"
"断。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:318
msgid ""
"**Hooks**: sync interceptors — validation or clarification at message "
"ingress, turn end, tool return, etc."
msgstr ""
"**Hooks**：同步拦截器——在消息入口、回合结束、工具返回等节点做校验或澄清"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:320
msgid ""
"Complementary: Pipeline Runner handles scheduled multi-step background work; "
"Hooks handle \"may this proceed before/during\"; EventBus remains available "
"for future cross-process fan-out but is not on the sleep path."
msgstr ""
"互补关系：Pipeline Runner 负责定时的多步后台任务；Hooks 处理「进行前/进行中是"
"否允许」；EventBus 保留供未来跨进程扇出，但不在睡眠路径上。"

